        <mxCell id="lld-flow-index-text" value="&lt;b&gt;S1&lt;/b&gt;: Source System -&gt; Network Load Balancer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S2&lt;/b&gt;: Source System -&gt; Kinesis Data Firehose&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S3&lt;/b&gt;: EDAP Ingestion Layer -&gt; Antivirus (Cloud Storage Security)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S4&lt;/b&gt;: EDAP Ingestion Layer -&gt; Step Functions (I2R Workflow)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S5&lt;/b&gt;: EDAP Ingestion Layer -&gt; Step Functions (I2R)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S6&lt;/b&gt;: Antivirus (Cloud Storage Security) -&gt; EDAP Ingestion Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S7&lt;/b&gt;: Lambda (RRD + Parquet Transform) -&gt; EDAP Raw Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S8&lt;/b&gt;: Lambda (RRD + Parquet Transform) -&gt; S3 processing-failed&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S9&lt;/b&gt;: EDAP Raw Layer -&gt; EDAP Conform Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S10&lt;/b&gt;: EDAP Raw Layer -&gt; Lake Formation&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S11&lt;/b&gt;: Azure Blob Storage -&gt; DataSync Agent (Azure-hosted)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S12&lt;/b&gt;: DataSync Agent (Azure-hosted) -&gt; AWS DataSync&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S13&lt;/b&gt;: External Database -&gt; AWS DMS&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S14&lt;/b&gt;: Step Functions (I2R Workflow) -&gt; Glue DataBrew (Quality)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S15&lt;/b&gt;: Step Functions (I2R Workflow) -&gt; Glue Job (Parquet + RRD Tag)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S16&lt;/b&gt;: Step Functions (I2R Workflow) -&gt; SQS Lineage Queue&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S17&lt;/b&gt;: Glue Job (Parquet + RRD Tag) -&gt; EDAP Raw Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S18&lt;/b&gt;: Internal Client -&gt; Route 53 Resolver&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S19&lt;/b&gt;: External Client -&gt; Amazon Route 53 (Public)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S20&lt;/b&gt;: Workload API -&gt; Azure APIM&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S21&lt;/b&gt;: Cloud Workloads -&gt; Microsoft Sentinel (SIEM)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S22&lt;/b&gt;: External Source -&gt; AWS Transfer Family (SFTP)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S23&lt;/b&gt;: Source Database -&gt; AWS DMS Replication Task&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S24&lt;/b&gt;: Stream Producer -&gt; Amazon Kinesis Data Streams&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S25&lt;/b&gt;: Application Layer -&gt; Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S26&lt;/b&gt;: Application Layer -&gt; Amazon DynamoDB&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S27&lt;/b&gt;: Application / BI Tool -&gt; Amazon Redshift&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S28&lt;/b&gt;: Ingestion Pipeline -&gt; AWS Glue DataBrew&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S29&lt;/b&gt;: Ingestion Pipeline -&gt; Amazon S3 (Data Lake)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S30&lt;/b&gt;: ETL Pipeline -&gt; Amazon S3 (Data Lake)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S31&lt;/b&gt;: Transform Pipeline -&gt; Amazon S3 (Data Lake)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S32&lt;/b&gt;: Metrics Producer -&gt; Amazon Timestream&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S33&lt;/b&gt;: Event Producer -&gt; Amazon EventBridge&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S34&lt;/b&gt;: Primary S3 Bucket -&gt; S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S35&lt;/b&gt;: Primary RDS -&gt; RDS Read Replica&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S36&lt;/b&gt;: All Pipeline Steps -&gt; AWS CloudTrail&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S37&lt;/b&gt;: Glue/Step Functions Jobs -&gt; SQS Lineage Queue&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S38&lt;/b&gt;: All Data Stores -&gt; AWS KMS (CMK)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S39&lt;/b&gt;: All Services -&gt; AWS ACM&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S40&lt;/b&gt;: Private Subnet Resources -&gt; VPC Endpoints&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S41&lt;/b&gt;: Internet -&gt; AWS WAF&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S42&lt;/b&gt;: Raw PII Data -&gt; AWS Glue DataBrew (Masking)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S43&lt;/b&gt;: All Workloads -&gt; Amazon CloudWatch Logs&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S44&lt;/b&gt;: All API Calls -&gt; AWS CloudTrail&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S45&lt;/b&gt;: On-Prem Business App -&gt; On-Prem SFTP Server&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S46&lt;/b&gt;: On-Prem SFTP Server -&gt; AWS Transfer Endpoint&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S47&lt;/b&gt;: AWS Transfer Family (SFTP) -&gt; EDAP Ingestion Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S48&lt;/b&gt;: AWS Transfer Family (SFTP) -&gt; Amazon S3 (Staging)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S49&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon Athena -&gt; EDAP Conform Layer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S50&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon Athena -&gt; A