 Optimization &amp; Usage Monitoring -&gt; Monitoring and Alerts&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S100&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon S3 (Staging) -&gt; AWS Glue (ETL)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S101&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon SQS -&gt; AWS Lambda (Event Consumer)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S102&lt;/b&gt;: AWS WAF -&gt; Application Load Balancer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S103&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon CloudWatch Alarms -&gt; Amazon SNS (Alerts)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S104&lt;/b&gt;: Amazon Route 53 -&gt; Application Load Balancer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S105&lt;/b&gt;: Power BI Gateway (EC2) -&gt; Amazon Athena&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S106&lt;/b&gt;: Analyst -&gt; Amazon Athena&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S107&lt;/b&gt;: EventBridge Scheduler -&gt; AWS Step Functions&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S108&lt;/b&gt;: EventBridge Trigger -&gt; AWS Step Functions&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S109&lt;/b&gt;: AWS Glue Crawler -&gt; AWS Glue Data Catalog&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S110&lt;/b&gt;: EventBridge Scheduler -&gt; Amazon EMR Cluster&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S111&lt;/b&gt;: Power BI Gateway (EC2) -&gt; Amazon Redshift (DataMart)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;S112&lt;/b&gt;: API Gateway (Export) -&gt; Amazon Redshift (DataMart)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
